// CotSC localization Batch 23: QCJKHAL
@1 = ~...~
@2 = ~Something a-about you is f-familiar, child. Your manner reminds me of a sage I know, by the n-name of Gorion.~
@3 = ~K-Khalid. It is your vision... from when we first met, at the Friendly Arm Inn. He looks so... full of life.~
@4 = ~It is almost a slight on him, but I see it too. <PRO_HESHE> looks...~
@5 = ~<PRO_HESHE> looks like <PRO_HESHE> is about to have <PRO_HISHER> blood spilled, with entrails decorating these very walls.~
@6 = ~This is a trap!~
@7 = ~Calm yourself, Imoen! This is not real. <CHARNAME>'s consciousness is playing with us. We need to fight.~
@8 = ~Oh, d-dear. Why would you d-do me any harm, Jaheira? I am y-y-your husband, am I n-not? Do you not love me anymore?~
@9 = ~Silence! You are not Khalid! Khalid's spirit is... no more! You will be just as much a casualty soon.~
@10 = ~Let us spill that blood, shall we, my love?~
@11 = ~As you wish, Jaheira.~
@12 = ~Something a-about you is f-familiar, child. Your manner reminds me of a sage I know, by the n-name of Gorion.~
